# Visual system

- No house palette. Do not invent a dark emerald ground, gold accents, or an "emerald night" theme. Color comes from the brief or from the page already on screen.
- No red-yellow-green flag stripes.
- Decorative art is generated, never emoji/sticker glyphs. Raw renders go through
  `scripts/process-art-v2.py` (Real-ESRGAN x4 upscale -> magenta chroma key -> WebP in `public/img/**`).
- Styles: `public/css/main.css`; font Rubik is self-hosted (`public/css/fonts.css`, `public/fonts/`).
- Partner styling is keyed by `data-partner` (`stake`, otherwise `generic`); partner bonus cards come from `src/_data/site.json -> partners`.
- All UI text is English.
- Do not restyle the admin panel (`public/admin/**`, `public/css/admin.css`).
